- **The cover's white edge (093, PT1): found and fixed in the build.** The cause was not the cover. A screenshot set beside its text was 2 px wider than the text column, because its border was added to its width. When anything is wider than the column, Chromium shrinks every page of the PDF to fit, here by about half a percent. That left a white line down the cover's right edge and along its foot, as you measured. Every other page was shrunk the same way, by too little to see.
